</p>
<dl><dd>Surely no NDA applies now, as the wiki is in the public domain? <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/User%20-%20Proleric1" title="User:Proleric1 (page does not exist)">Proleric1</a> 07:47, 15 October 2009 (UTC)
<dl><dd>Probably not. I'll ask around to make sure, though. <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/User%20-%20BryanDerksen" title="User:BryanDerksen">BryanDerksen</a> 19:44, 15 October 2009 (UTC)</dd>
